<title>GREECE: ATHLETICS-GARCIA WINS WORLD MEN'S 20 KMS WALK TITLE.</title>
<headline>ATHLETICS-GARCIA WINS WORLD MEN'S 20 KMS WALK TITLE.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-08-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mexican Daniel Garcia  won the men's 20 kms walk gold medal on the opening day of the world championships on Saturday.</p>
<p>Mikhail Shchennikov of Russia took the silver and Belarus's Mikhail Khmelnitsky the bronze.</p>
</text>
